* perform-keyword-inline/MAIN.NSP — issue #41 regression fixture.
* An inline DEFINE SUBROUTINE named after a Natural keyword (CLEAR), plus a
* PERFORM CLEAR that must resolve to it. Before the fix the lexer emitted a
* keyword token for CLEAR and the parser dropped the name, so the subroutine
* had no identity and go-to-definition on PERFORM CLEAR returned nothing.

DEFINE DATA
LOCAL
  1 RESULT (A10)
END DEFINE

DEFINE SUBROUTINE CLEAR
  MOVE 'INLINE' TO RESULT
END SUBROUTINE

PERFORM CLEAR

END
